&lt;li&gt;Set up, operate, and supervise the operation of all tube-bending equipment while working to close tolerances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering to prove out designs to blueprint with minimum fixtures and short schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve tube fitment issues and document changes for further development work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage actions to improve both quality and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
