&lt;li&gt;Previous training in lean/continuous improvement tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set up and operate tube fabrication equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret blueprints and articulate work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of tube cleaning requirements for aerospace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of orbital tube welding (OTW)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with manual tubing benders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
