&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our Aurora-based pediatric client would love a nurse who has experience (or is willing to learn) with trach/ vent care. He would also love someone to watch Team Umi Zoomi with him at night while he winds down for bed and keep him safe while he is sleeping! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Choose BAYADA?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
