&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care &lt;/strong&gt;is seeking&amp;nbsp;a &lt;strong&gt;Habilitation Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to join our &lt;strong&gt;Erie, PA Habilitation Home Care &lt;/strong&gt;office. If you are looking for an exciting career opportunity in a growing industry, a &lt;strong&gt;Habilitation Manager&lt;/strong&gt; could be the position for you!&lt;/p&gt;
